      "class": "dataset",
      "label": "Voting rates in elections to the Riksdag, County Councils and Municipal Councils by region. Year of election 1973-2022",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2022-11-21T07:00:00Z",
      "link": {
